    "text": "<p>For the given figures, choose the correct options:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/29a62bfb-4c63-4350-9ed5-313a18649019-9895167q.PNG\" style=\"width: 523px; height: 190px;\" /></p>",
